                  "to": 102.345,
                  "from": 98.905,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2910130,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This is a fascinating island in the Irish Sea, with Wales to the South, England to the East, Scotland to the North, and Northern Ireland to the West.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.505,
                  "from": 102.665,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2910153,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our holiday starts in Heesham, where your tour manager will meet you, then you'll travel by ferry to the Isle Of Man.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 121.78999,
                  "from": 113.46999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2910176,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some people prefer to fly from Luton instead, and another popular option is to go by train to Liverpool and take a ferry from there.",
