            "content": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 77.095%; height: 813px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 69px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 92.3913%; height: 69px;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"510\">\n<p><strong>Timetable for Isle of Man holiday</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 69px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 69px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 69px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p><strong>Activity</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 69px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p><strong>Notes</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 186px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 186px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>Day 1</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 186px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p>Arrive</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 186px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p>Introduction by manager</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hotel dining room has view of the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_15\">______</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 93px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 93px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>Day 2</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 93px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p>Tynwald Exhibition and Peel</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 93px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p>Tynwald may have been founded in <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_16\">______</span> not 979.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 117px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>Day 3</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 117px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p>Trip to Snaefell</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 117px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p>Travel along promenade in a tram; train to Laxey; train to the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_17\">______</span> of Snaefell</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 93px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 93px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>Day 4</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 93px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p>Free day</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 93px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p>Company provides a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_18\">______</span> for local transport and heritage sites.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 117px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>Day 5</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 117px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p>Take the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_19\">______</span> railway train from Douglas to Port Erin</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 117px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p>Free time, then coach to Castletown &ndash; former <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_20\">______</span> has old castle.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 69px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 10.8696%; height: 69px;\" width=\"60\">\n<p>Day 6</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.9565%; height: 69px;\" width=\"204\">\n<p>Leave</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 44.5652%; height: 69px;\" width=\"246\">\n<p>Leave the island by ferry or plane</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
